"Find the best spot" is a policy that changes independently of the lot itself — swap it without touching `ParkingLot`.

```text
interface ParkingStrategy:
    method findSpot(floors: List<ParkingFloor>, type: SpotType): ParkingSpot

class NearestSpotStrategy implements ParkingStrategy:
    method findSpot(floors, type): ParkingSpot:
        // lowest floor first, then first free matching spot on it
        for floor in floors.sortedBy(f -> f.level):
            candidates = floor.availableSpots(type)
            if candidates.isNotEmpty():
                return candidates.first()
        return null
```
